    u8_array_into_word_array_residual_shapes_2026-11-28, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep7-20261128 (four residual admission holes closed: Option-typed values, Option<T> generic spelling, nested-field receivers, builtin push/append element compare - all now E1003; untyped-list relay pinned as admitted); spec 6/6, 41/41 tests 2026-11-28", Option<[i64]> parameter spelling, non-local trait receivers and builtin push into [[i64]] are still unchecked", src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/hir/lower/module_lowering/function.rs, 511, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    u8_array_into_word_array_residual_shapes_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 owner decision: keep the assignment slot firing on inferred word-array locals; fix the root instead: text.bytes() must be typed [u8] (byte data; crypto API already uses [u8]), after which the five `: [u8]` annotations become redundant."
    u8_array_into_word_array_residual_shapes_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep7: reproduced the record's shapes on a scratch build (p1 [u8]? into [i64]? admitted; p2 Option<[i64]> spelling admitted; p3b nested-field receiver admitted; p4 [[i64]].push([u8]) admitted). Root causes + fixes (hir/lower only): is_u8_array_value now probes option_payload (function.rs:574) and reject_u8_array_into peels the value's option (:589); numeric_array_param_element also peels the Option<T> generic spelling (:619 - feeds later-fn/method/trait rows); trait_method_param_rows gains a FieldAccess arm resolving the field's authored declared type (expr/mod.rs:2380,2413); builtin push/append gains reject_u8_array_push_element (function.rs:683) with the untyped-empty refinement exempt. Spec seed_u8_word_array_residual_shapes 6/6 on the fixed scratch; cargo function_tests 41/41; full lib 5179 passed 16 pre-existing; 100-file fallout oracle zero u8-rule hits. Residuals: (5) untyped list relays stay admitted (element type erases to ANY - needs provenance tracking, pinned in both test and spec, runtime write-trap still backs it); text.bytes() NOT retyped to [u8] (runtime builds a word array; pinned test asserts [i64]; separate change with runtime work). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/seed_u8_word_array_residual_shapes_spec.spl prevention=src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/hir/lower/module_lowering/function.rs"

